      "text": "A web page section headed \"Capstone Project & Internships\" for the NUS MTech EBAC programme. A red rectangle encloses the paragraph describing the project module -- five months full-time, 7 to 12 months part-time, 30 man-days per team member and a mandatory four-day course. Objectives, learning outcomes and a Timetable & Exams table for full-time students follow.",
